# Grill — clickable multiple choice

When using **grilling**, **grill-me**, or **grill-with-docs**:

1. Ask each frontier round via the Cursor **AskQuestion** tool (mouse-selectable options), not markdown-only Q lists.
2. One AskQuestion call per round; one question per frontier decision; 2–4 options; recommended option first.
3. If AskQuestion is unavailable in the session, say so once and fall back to the grilling markdown format.
4. Confirm shared understanding before implementing.
